sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor D as Demandeur
    participant UI as Angular (TicketForm)
    participant API as TicketController
    participant S as TicketService
    participant PM as PriorityMatrix
    participant SLA as SlaService
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant N as NotificationService
    D->>UI: saisit titre, description, impact, urgence
    UI->>UI: affiche la priorité indicative (matrice)
    UI->>API: POST /api/tickets (JWT)
    API->>API: validation Bean Validation (taille, bornes 1..3)
    API->>S: create(request)
    S->>DB: lockByYear(2026) + next() — référence INC-2026-00043
    S->>PM: compute(impact, urgency)
    PM-->>S: P3
    S->>SLA: applyDeadlines(ticket)
    SLA->>DB: findByPriority(P3)
    SLA-->>S: responseDueAt = +4 h, resolutionDueAt = +24 h
    S->>DB: save(ticket) + history(status: null→NEW)
    S->>N: ticketCreated(ticket)
    N-->>D: e-mail de confirmation
    S-->>API: TicketResponse (201 Created)
    API-->>UI: JSON
    UI-->>D: redirection vers la fiche du ticket
